  { q: 'Is barbecuing on a balcony in Spain banned by law?', a: 'There is no national law that bans it. The ban is usually in the statutes or house rules of the comunidad, sometimes in a municipal bylaw. On top of that you may not cause your neighbours a nuisance, and that includes smoke.' },
